   "thinking": "I'm nudging the scaling factor s_o up to 7.5 for safety, with some small bias adjustments. I'm also working through the column sums, starting with the totals for columns 7, 8, 9, 5, and 1.\n\nI'm working through the remaining column sums, then checking the tweaks: lowering entries 1, 8 and 3 by 0.1 and raising entry 7 by 0.1, which looks fine. That leaves the scaling factor at 7.5.\n\n",
